OL,3,AFiona Harvey to appear at Crown Court
OL,4,Aon harassment charge
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman who allegedly inspired the
OL,7,Fstalker character Martha in the hit
OL,8,FNetflix drama Baby Reindeer is to
OL,9,Fappear at Harrow Crown Court on charges
OL,10,Fof racially aggravated harassment
OL,11,Fwithout violence.
OL,13,FFiona Harvey, 61, is accused of sending
OL,14,Fseveral emails and three voicemails
OL,15,Fincluding antisemitic material to
OL,16,Flawyer Mark Lewis, between 4 September
OL,17,Fand 9 October 2025.
OL,19,FDuring a hearing at Highbury Corner
OL,20,FMagistrates' Court on Thursday, the
OL,21,Fcourt heard that Lewis initially
OL,22,Fbelieved Harvey was a potential client.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,164,160,200,105,0,100
